// Cockpit UI: safety lock, a switch. One file, no dependencies: load it with a script tag and use <cockpit-lock>.
// The paintings are inside this file as data, and so is a copy of the shared core, so it works on its own.
// Do not edit between the >>> and <<< markers: tools/build.mjs writes those parts.
// 03 safety lock: a switch. The sheet, the toggle (painted twice, thrown each way) and the screen bezel are paintings; the screen is drawn
// in code. Throw it to RELEASE and the four clamps let go one after another; when the last one goes, the restraints blow off.
